{
  "_comment": [
    "Benchmark the SETTLEMENT (DvP) path of OpenZeppelin's canton-token-template,",
    "through the real CIP-0056 interface choice",
    "  AllocationFactory_Allocate  (splice-api-token-allocation-instruction-v1)",
    "",
    "This is the flow institutional settlement actually uses: a sender allocates",
    "an asset to a settlement identified by a reference, naming an executor and a",
    "deadline. Their factory archives the inputs, creates a LockedSimpleHolding",
    "held by the admin until settleBefore, creates the SimpleAllocation, and",
    "returns change — strictly more work per operation than a plain transfer.",
    "",
    "Argument shape taken from their own tests",
    "(simple-token-test/daml/SimpleToken/Test/Allocation.daml, mkAllocationArgs).",
    "",
    "  node src/cli.ts run E:/ozt/simple-token/.daml/dist/simple-token-0.1.0.dar \\",
    "    --workload-file examples/openzeppelin/workload-allocation.json \\",
    "    --model closed --concurrency 8 --ops 60 --sandbox --java-home <jdk>"
  ],

  "version": 1,
  "parties": 6,
  "roles": ["admin", "executor"],

  "setup": [
    {
      "id": "rules",
      "disclose": true,
      "actAs": ["$role:admin"],
      "op": {
        "kind": "create",
        "template": "#simple-token:SimpleToken.Rules:SimpleTokenRules",
        "args": { "admin": "$role:admin", "supportedInstruments": ["SIMPLE"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "holdings",
      "count": 400,
      "actAs": ["$role:admin", "$p0"],
      "op": {
        "kind": "create",
        "template": "#simple-token:SimpleToken.Holding:SimpleHolding",
        "args": {
          "admin": "$role:admin",
          "owner": "$p0",
          "instrumentId": { "admin": "$role:admin", "id": "SIMPLE" },
          "amount": "1000.0",
          "meta": { "values": {} }
        }
      }
    }
  ],

  "operations": [
    {
      "weight": 1,
      "op": {
        "kind": "exercise",
        "template": "#splice-api-token-allocation-instruction-v1:Splice.Api.Token.AllocationInstructionV1:AllocationFactory",
        "contract": "$ref:rules",
        "choice": "AllocationFactory_Allocate",
        "args": {
          "expectedAdmin": "$role:admin",
          "allocation": {
            "settlement": {
              "executor": "$role:executor",
              "settlementRef": { "id": "bench-settlement", "cid": null },
              "requestedAt": "$now-60s",
              "allocateBefore": "$now+1h",
              "settleBefore": "$now+2h",
              "meta": { "values": {} }
            },
            "transferLegId": "leg-1",
            "transferLeg": {
              "sender": "$p0",
              "receiver": "$p1",
              "amount": "1.0",
              "instrumentId": { "admin": "$role:admin", "id": "SIMPLE" },
              "meta": { "values": {} }
            }
          },
          "requestedAt": "$now-60s",
          "inputHoldingCids": ["$ref:holdings[*]"],
          "extraArgs": { "context": { "values": {} }, "meta": { "values": {} } }
        }
      },
      "submit": { "actAs": ["$p0"] }
    }
  ]
}
